        "text": "Lines 1, 2, 9 and 10 cover the city. Fares ¥2-5; trains run about 06:00-22:30."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Bus",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Buses cost ¥1-2 and take cash or Alipay/WeChat QR codes. Routes are hard to read without Chinese."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Taxi / ride apps",
        "has": true,
        "best": true,
        "text": "Taxis start at ¥8 for 3 km then about ¥1.8/km; insist the meter is visible. Didi works well and is easiest for foreign visitors."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Rental car",
        "has": false,
        "text": "Not needed. Traffic and parking are hard for visitors; use metro and Didi instead."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Walking",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Central sights in Shenhe are walkable. Beiling and Dongling need transport."
      },
      {
        "mode": "Tram",
        "has": true,
        "text": "Tram line 2 links Taoxian Airport to the metro; the total trip downtown takes just over an hour."
      }
